{"summary":"Puzzle Game: Sort and Merge 3 Cards","description":"This brain puzzle game involves collecting and merging cards of the same color among various cards. Conquer extensive levels to become a puzzle master.\n\n[How to Play]\n- When 3 cards of the same color gather in the storage, they are removed.\n- Even a large number of cards can be taken at once if they can be removed in sets of three.\n- When bringing cards, if there are cards of the same color in the storage, they merge and are removed.\n- Strategize which cards to bring to the 5-slot storage.\n- Clear the stage by removing all cards.\n- You fail if the storage is filled with cards of different colors.\n- Bring the bomb card quickly, or you will fail.\n- Earn stars by succeeding in a short amount of time.\n\n[Features]\n- Offers easy rules and relaxing game play.\n- No time limits or action points, play anytime, anywhere.\n- Provides Speed Quiz, Infinite Mode, and Classic Stages.\n- Compete with other users in weekly rankings for rewards.\n- Collect gold cards to obtain skins for landmarks, rugby balls, animals, and more.\n- Receive rubies and gold cards as rewards at regular intervals.\n- Play the game without a network connection.\n\nHelp : cs@mobirix.com\n\nHomepage :\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=4864673505117639552","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $99.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-wkyhG12izc?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Vp0sBajaaNVRm-aZzTd0BvnnAbzUtgS35cwEC-Bke7izNvFkI7_ymwpfYiPH2hPECNMEmnFZXlxYYuRryiU4UA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rFPYhdsBlxx-sCBTEHHhzREFeE-tSQJ_L5sM-iktl8CwvihDWYyDNQX3Gcj4pEz6mNXsukyRj6AWtKsOWZWDlQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lTFxymbpzswkEdsqGDR0Mvx36xIny35bq7tVdwKrFGuAnnp5J1LcfZLFOrSf3ENz7TdkzHJXmOOLNp62FR9IOQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1klxpWBgSFWWO0wCxsUDJr6HeYOzYEtOivL0vetvsl2npn4RmZchTgmluOXrSi6-B1m0HJG6ZJd